1-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oX68hGNrTSI5IFJnGpWM2AMYWbO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oX68hGNrTSI5IFJnGpWM2AMYWbO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/96196/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"2679494","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"第三の厨具「魔聖銅器」を手に入れたマオ一行は第四の厨具のありか四川に向かうために、長江を渡る。マオの存在を警戒し、裏料理界最強幹部の五虎星が動き出す。その先陣を切ったのは「爆炎厨師」の異名をもつ“豹子頭”アルカン。マオvsアルカン、長江火工勝負の火ぶたが切って落とされる！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iLLeIv7VjKgtFIAGK66N2JKd7PL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iLLeIv7VjKgtFIAGK66N2JKd7PL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/96196/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"2680717","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"チョウユ師傅より直伝された火工の神髄を見せるマオの二品に対して、アルカンは更なる火工のスケールを見せ、長江を火の海と化して、究極の焼き魚で対抗する。マオの二品とアルカンの一品。審査員シェルの心の天秤が揺れ、判定はどうなる！？　一方、勝負の裏にシャンが再び現れ…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h5ZEjf0CYX6LTkbmSTwhdqs5wWp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h5ZEjf0CYX6LTkbmSTwhdqs5wWp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/96196/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"2684349","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャンの乱入により、シェル＆レオンと二手に分断されたマオ、メイリィとシロウ。マオたちはマオの生家「菊下楼」を目指すことに。休業中のはずだった「菊下楼」は何故か営業しており、厨房で料理を振舞っていたのはジュチと名乗る少年だった。さらにジュチはメイリィに猛アタックする。マオの心は大きく揺れる…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cs0SqyaWvwbtFjlsnmVpFmXZSWY.jpg",